": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210393_852485259855759_6019629505745872437_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PcPqXw5lRkgQ7kNvwF_0u2u&_nc_oc=Adqpg3j4MJJ2pMsNbOm66C7cAEjyf9GQILdlIoKl4O4uh6giP7GYBgWkxwNTivI4h98&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGhFDk77HwvhDLGa-FEiRzhuBtdZNTeN8wZ_MRzntQ3sw&oe=6A7F04DB"}, {"file_name": "sc1.png", "id": "1698965373936946", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982551_1698965377270279_7553645442698234559_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qZV_lTJKXeoQ7kNvwHp68QJ&_nc_oc=AdoJbRWfJx66694jdQLHCRDsRCOJ7zM0kr9Jp72iFC9ptr9txZqpThiRxX-L_q9cXqA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGDYi71JudpU3IvsuS5uJH7B9-8CfGWVxCpMYtE9r-JNg&oe=6A7F2D61"}, {"file_name": "sc3.png", "id": "362227642863079", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_362227646196412_4627867009706605201_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IFFaqQaLqT0Q7kNvwGRQttl&_nc_oc=AdoIHlnKZUbcGttdQyob0yuO9rcnwUPI9BfpNSMdR_VmmRKCaP1OOw885VEHveXwNqA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGBP0HUP5wiOWUAxUFWXHD5SaqXHzVmuPvxnjHj5Wwg_w&oe=6A7F1A2F"}, {"file_name": "sc5.png", "id": "167386486400512", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982562_167386489733845_2832025039911865533_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HTfOSA7HmOQQ7kNvwGIM9kc&_nc_oc=AdpDWmRY1sV5e6VaxqNImyiwwSDTftEc5tmD2Vu7_5hD3i0ETy6ALTcI8F7WxwMhXyc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHNatXPx25Gbx54EANBRfiBQnJkBd0tKpJU--569KOIvQ&oe=6A7F19D2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "sc4.png", "id": "860094495571873", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240101_860094502238539_6759068810652291731_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EoIM-ev6-fEQ7kNvwFy22er&_nc_oc=AdqWnQv2l09pwnV2qAefJTuMG_zyyTWs9sVPs0ami-IDup1TWV3O6uD8rCcay_GsY-8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFpsQN0g-yZEUJlxeWwOQ0D03y8488lJLCrSzl7V5HbPA&oe=6A7F237D"}, "display_name": "Ball smasher", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. \n\nWhether you prefer the satisfying thud of a baseball bat connecting with a ball or the raw power of using your fists, the ball smasher offers a unique and cathartic way to let off steam. \n\nIt transforms the act of stress relief into a physical and engaging activity. So, the next time stress looms, head to the ball smasher and unleash your frustration on those unsuspecting balls. It's not just a stress reliever; it's a fun and dynamic approach to coping with life's pressures, promoting a healthier and more balanced mindset. \n\nTake a swing, make a hit, and feel the tension melt away as you engage in this unconventional yet effective stress-busting activity.", "short_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://artisoft.pl/policies/bs_v1.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Artisoft", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bs.a